comments.body:
REVIEW WANTED: opus

Fable-authored (ADR 0013 storage tiers, docs plus new lot issues). The operator's answers to Q1–Q15 are the ground truth; the PR body and the ADR must state them faithfully, with no added scope. Key points:
- blacklist and bookmarks stay in MPStorage;
- MPStorage sync is on by default when a storage thread exists;
- iCloud KVS only for what has no place in MPStorage, or for restore;
- opt-in iCloud Keychain account sync plus a Face ID lock;
- the fine reading position syncs through KVS, and HFR flags stay the cross-platform position;
- Bybifok's UX recommendations are not implemented;
- the same bundle id means legacy data is kept on upgrade.
Also check the LOTS.md rows (9 cells) with check-lot-deps.py, and that the new issues are deduplicated.
